#: includes/doroto-view-model.php:316
msgid "skipped"
msgstr "已跳過"

#. translators: %d: number of players who must stay free
#: includes/doroto-view-model.php:98
msgid ""
"While matches are being played, another match is drawn only when at least %d"
" players stay free, so that the teams keep changing. It will be drawn when a"
" match finishes."
msgstr "比賽進行時，只有至少剩下 %d 名空閒選手才會抽籤新的比賽，以便隊伍不斷變化。新比賽將在某場比賽結束時抽籤。"

#: includes/doroto-view-model.php:95
msgid ""
"The next matches are drawn when all matches being played are finished "
"(setting \"When enough players are available\")."
msgstr "下一輪比賽將在所有進行中的比賽結束後抽籤（設定「有足夠選手時」）。"

#. translators: %d: number of courts that can be used
#: includes/doroto-view-model.php:89
msgid ""
"There are not enough players for all courts; at most %d matches can be "
"played at once."
msgstr "選手不足以覆蓋所有場地；最多可同時進行 %d 場比賽。"

#. translators: %d: number of skipped matches
#: includes/doroto-services.php:215
msgid "%d match was skipped."
msgid_plural "%d matches were skipped."
msgstr[0] "已跳過 %d 場比賽。"

#: includes/doroto-services.php:206
msgid "The tournament could not be created."
msgstr "無法建立賽事。"

#: includes/doroto-services.php:202
msgid "You have left the tournament."
msgstr "您已退出賽事。"

#: includes/doroto-services.php:170
msgid ""
"The tournament was closed more than 24 hours ago and can no longer be "
"changed."
msgstr "賽事已關閉超過 24 小時，無法再更改。"

#: includes/doroto-services.php:168
msgid "Unknown tournament type."
msgstr "未知的賽事型別。"

#: includes/doroto-services.php:160
msgid "The founder of the tournament cannot be removed."
msgstr "不能移除賽事建立者。"

#: includes/doroto-services.php:158
msgid "The user is not an organizer of this tournament."
msgstr "該使用者不是此賽事的組織者。"

#: includes/doroto-services.php:156
msgid "Organizers cannot be added to a closed tournament."
msgstr "不能向已關閉的賽事新增組織者。"

#: includes/doroto-services.php:154
msgid "The player has no recorded payment."
msgstr "該選手沒有付款記錄。"

#: includes/doroto-services.php:148
msgid "The player is not in the special group."
msgstr "該選手不在特殊組中。"

#: includes/doroto-services.php:146
msgid "The player is already in the special group."
msgstr "該選手已在特殊組中。"

#: includes/doroto-services.php:128
msgid "Players cannot be suspended in a closed tournament."
msgstr "已關閉的賽事中不能暫停選手。"

#: includes/doroto-services.php:124
msgid "The player is not in this tournament."
msgstr "該選手不在此賽事中。"

#: includes/doroto-services.php:122
msgid "Players cannot be added to a closed tournament."
msgstr "不能向已關閉的賽事新增選手。"

#: includes/doroto-services.php:114
msgid "This match has not been played yet."
msgstr "這場比賽尚未進行。"

#: includes/doroto-services.php:112
msgid "Results of this tournament can no longer be changed."
msgstr "此賽事的結果已無法更改。"

#: includes/doroto-services.php:89
msgid "The tournament was reopened."
msgstr "賽事已重新開放。"

#: includes/doroto-services.php:88 includes/doroto-services.php:192
msgid "The tournament was closed."
msgstr "賽事已關閉。"

#: includes/doroto-services.php:77
msgid "Registration cannot be changed in a closed tournament."
msgstr "已關閉的賽事中不能更改報名。"

#: includes/doroto-help.php:255
msgid ""
"The players of the special group have their own winner in this tournament "
"(setting \"The winner of the tournament will be\")."
msgstr "在此賽事中，特殊組選手有自己的冠軍（設定「賽事冠軍為」）。"

#: includes/doroto-help.php:245
msgid "Results can be filtered by player."
msgstr "可按選手篩選結果。"

#: includes/doroto-help.php:240
msgid ""
"The label \"suspended\" next to the names of Iga Swiatek and Novak Djokovic "
"shows that their game is still suspended."
msgstr "伊加·斯瓦泰克和諾瓦克·德約科維奇名字旁的「已暫停」標記表示他們的比賽仍處於暫停狀態。"

#: includes/doroto-help.php:221
msgid ""
"The organizer can skip several matches at once, for example when players "
"have left. The next matches are drawn from all free players."
msgstr "組織者可以一次跳過多場比賽，例如在選手離開時。下一輪比賽從所有空閒選手中抽籤。"

#: includes/doroto-help.php:219
msgid ""
"Team 1 is at the top, team 2 at the bottom. In each team, the first player "
"plays on the left side of the court and the second one on the right side. "
"The player marked \"serves\" starts the game by serving."
msgstr "第 1 隊在上，第 2 隊在下。每隊第一名選手在場地左側，第二名在右側。標記「發球」的選手以發球開始該局。"

#: includes/doroto-help.php:218
msgid ""
"Every match has its number. You will find it in the results and in the "
"statistics."
msgstr "每場比賽都有編號。您可以在結果和統計中找到它。"

#: includes/doroto-help.php:216
msgid ""
"The estimate uses the average match result and the number of games played "
"per hour from the settings."
msgstr "估算使用設定中的平均比賽結果和每小時進行的局數。"

#: includes/doroto-help.php:165
msgid ""
"Click this icon to view help. It will guide you through the various options "
"for how a rotation tournament works and how to set them up."
msgstr "點選此圖示檢視幫助。它將引導您瞭解輪換賽的各種運作方式及其設定方法。"

#: includes/doroto-help.php:154
msgid ""
"Add a player from the player database, or create a new account for a player."
" The new player gets an e-mail with a link to set the password."
msgstr "從選手資料庫新增選手，或為新選手建立帳號。新選手會收到一封帶有設定密碼連結的電子郵件。"

#: includes/doroto-help.php:149 includes/doroto-help.php:247
msgid ""
"Choose a player to see how many times they played with each player as a "
"teammate and against them."
msgstr "選擇一名選手，檢視其與每位選手作為搭檔以及作為對手各比賽了多少次。"

#: includes/doroto-help.php:146
msgid ""
"Enter the score of both teams and press Save. The next match is drawn right "
"away."
msgstr "輸入兩隊的比分並點選儲存。下一場比賽會立即抽籤。"

#: includes/doroto-help.php:144
msgid ""
"The tournament is divided into tabs. The page updates itself every 30 "
"seconds, so you do not need to reload it."
msgstr "賽事分為多個標籤。頁面每 30 秒自動更新，無需重新載入。"

#: includes/doroto-help.php:142
msgid ""
"The presentation shows the matches, the standings and the results one after "
"another on the whole screen. Especially suitable for displaying the running "
"results of the tournament on a larger screen."
msgstr "演示會全螢幕依次顯示比賽、排名和結果。特別適合在大螢幕上顯示賽事的即時結果。"

#: includes/doroto-help.php:141 includes/doroto-help.php:201
msgid ""
"Share the tournament: a QR code and links for the players. The QR code opens"
" the tournament in the Android app, or on this website when the app is not "
"installed."
msgstr "分享賽事：為選手提供QR 碼和連結。QR 碼會在 Android 應用程式中開啟賽事，若未安裝應用程式則在本網站開啟。"

#: includes/doroto-help.php:138
msgid ""
"The name of the tournament, its state, the type of the game and the number "
"of players. While the tournament runs, the bar shows its progress and the "
"estimated time to the end."
msgstr "賽事名稱、狀態、比賽型別和選手人數。賽事進行中，進度條會顯示進度和預計結束時間。"

#: includes/doroto-help.php:108 includes/doroto-help.php:136
msgid "Tour of this page"
msgstr "本頁導覽"

#: includes/doroto-blocks.php:305
msgid "Tournament Selection"
msgstr "選擇賽事"

#: includes/doroto-blocks.php:251
msgid "Longitude"
msgstr "經度"

#: includes/doroto-blocks.php:250
msgid "Latitude"
msgstr "緯度"

